sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Staff as Nhan vien kiem duyet (Staff / Admin)
    participant UI as React Web App (Back-office Portal)
    participant Ctrl as AiCurationController
    participant Svc as AiCurationService
    participant RepoRep as MisclassifiedReportRepository
    participant RepoDS as VerifiedDatasetRepository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (ApplicationDbContext)

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
    Note over Staff, DB: Giai doan 1: Tiep nhan hang doi kiem duyet AI (SCR-STF-02)
    Staff->>+UI: 1. Mo man hinh 'Hang doi kiem duyet AI'
    UI->>+Ctrl: 2. GET /api/v1/staff/ai-curation/reports?status=Pending&page=1&size=20
    Ctrl->>+Svc: 3. GetPendingReportsAsync(page, size, ct)
    Svc->>+RepoRep: 4. GetPendingListAsync(page, size)
    RepoRep->>+DB: 5. SELECT r.*, s.image_url, c.category_name FROM misclassified_reports r ... WHERE r.status = 'Pending'
    DB-->>-RepoRep: 6. Return List<MisclassifiedReport> kem ImageUrl & Label
    RepoRep-->>-Svc: 7. Return reports
    Svc-->>-Ctrl: 8. Return PagedResult<CurationReportItemDto>
    Ctrl-->>-UI: 9. 200 OK: ApiResponse<PagedResult<CurationReportItemDto>>
    UI-->>-Staff: 10. Hien thi danh sach anh, nhan AI du doan va nhan User de xuat
    end

    rect rgb(245, 255, 250)
    Note over Staff, DB: Giai doan 2: Nhan vien tham dinh nhan va duyet dua vao kho du lieu Retrain
    Staff->>+UI: 11. Xem anh thuc te, chon nhan chuan xac, chon DatasetSplit='Train' va bam 'Phe duyet'
    UI->>+Ctrl: 12. POST /api/v1/staff/ai-curation/reports/{reportId}/verify (Body: CurateReportRequestDto)
    Ctrl->>+Svc: 13. VerifyAndCurateReportAsync(reportId, staffId, dto, ct)
    Svc->>+RepoRep: 14. GetByIdAsync(reportId)
    RepoRep->>+DB: 15. SELECT * FROM misclassified_reports WHERE report_id = @id
    DB-->>-RepoRep: 16. Return report entity
    RepoRep-->>-Svc: 17. Return report
    Svc->>+RepoRep: 18. UpdateAsync(report.Approve(staffId, verifiedCatId))
    RepoRep->>+DB: 19. UPDATE misclassified_reports SET status='Reviewed', staff_verified_category_id=..., reviewed_by=..., reviewed_at=NOW()
    DB-->>-RepoRep: 20. 1 row affected
    RepoRep-->>-Svc: 21. Complete Task
    Svc->>+RepoDS: 22. AddAsync(VerifiedDataset { imageUrl, catId, split='Train', verifiedBy=staffId })
    RepoDS->>+DB: 23. INSERT INTO verified_datasets (category_id, image_url, dataset_split, verified_by_staff_id, verified_at)
    DB-->>-RepoDS: 24. 1 row affected (dataset_id)
    RepoDS-->>-Svc: 25. Complete Task
    Svc-->>-Ctrl: 26. Return true
    Ctrl-->>-UI: 27. 200 OK: ApiResponse<object> (MSG-CUR-02: Phe duyet nhan thanh cong)
    UI-->>-Staff: 28. Toast thong bao: Anh da duoc dua vao tap du lieu chuan bi Retrain!
    end
